UID:fun-time-pony-8f71ac85abda961b5b5a3c26bcb94204
DESCRIPTION:Bursting with sun-soaked melodies and woozy guitar licks\, ind
 ie-rock sweethearts Mid Drift have swiftly captured hearts all across Aust
 ralia\, selling out two national headliner tours in 2025. Between major su
 pport slots alongside Aussie crowd favourites Ocean Alley\, Old Mervs\, an
 d DICE and appearances at renowned Australian festivals such as Laneway an
 d Rolling Sets Festival\, the female fronted 5-piece show no signs of slow
 ing down having announced their sophomore EP ‘Good At Avoiding’ is set
  to come out on 17th February 2026.
